WEBVTT

00:23:57.876 --> 00:24:00.596
CA: I mean, Bill Gates probably
benefited for a long time

00:24:00.620 --> 00:24:03.028
from having Steve Ballmer there,

00:24:03.052 --> 00:24:06.633
driving the Microsoft
sales force and so forth,

00:24:06.657 --> 00:24:12.373
while holding the reins on figuring out
the strategic vision forward.

00:24:12.397 --> 00:24:18.817
And even though he was introverted,
he was a fierce competitor --

00:24:18.841 --> 00:24:20.015
like, really fierce.

00:24:20.039 --> 00:24:21.148
(Laughter)

00:24:21.172 --> 00:24:22.789
CA: But as you say, he's done OK.

00:24:22.813 --> 00:24:26.537
SC: But people assume
that if you're introverted,

00:24:26.561 --> 00:24:29.208
you wouldn't be competitive,
you wouldn't be ambitious,

00:24:29.232 --> 00:24:33.094
and that's not necessarily so,
it just kind of shows up differently.